      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This prayer of praise of Tsar Alexander II (1818-1881), for largely ending feudalism by emancipating the serfs of the Russian Empire was written by an unknown author and published in <tei:hi rend="italic">HaMelitz</tei:hi> on Thursday, 28 March 1861. Many thnaks to Nir Krakauer for proofreading and correcting my translation. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
